SUMMARY:Illusions and Hallucinations
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**Illusions and 
 Hallucinations**\n**Atrium Group Ritual presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.*
 *\n\nThis Rosicrucian message explains how impressions that come from our 
 physical senses can be interpreted widely from person to person. And it br
 eaks down how hallucinations are mental aberrations that are entirely prod
 ucts of a subconscious process.\n\nAll AMORC members\, their families and 
 friends of the Rosicrucian Order are welcome to attend. We are delighted t
 o have you join us in this inspiring ritual.\n\n• Important to know- Doo
 rs open for members and non-member friends of the Rosicrucian Order by 6:3
 0 PM. Please arrive early! The Atrium Group ritual begins promptly at 7:00
  PM. AMORC Members - please bring your Active member credentials or Active
  membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday- Mystical
  Seekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos o
 perates under the law of AMRA. You may give as your heart and mind direct 
 you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\, an affi
 liated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Americas and th
 e Caribbean.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31658
 3726/
