SUMMARY:Making Your Dreams Come True
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nMystical Seekers Series\
 n-Free Admission - Refreshments - Open to the public -\n\nMaking Your Drea
 ms Come True\nwritten by H. Spencer Lewis\, Ph.D.\, F.R.C.\n\nIn this mess
 age we learn that human beings have the divine faculty of unlimited imagin
 ation. Dr. Lewis explains by building upon on our dreams little by little 
 every day we can attract conditions to ourselves that can help us realize 
 our dreams.\n\nAbout the Santa Rosa Pronaos\nWe hold a monthly public pres
 entation on mystical or metaphysical topics as a public service. The topic
 s and speakers vary and no previous knowledge or experience is required. J
 ust bring an open mind and heart.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos doesn't charge
  for admission. We operate under the law of AMRA. You may give as your hea
 rt and mind direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational n
 onprofit\, an affiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for t
 he Americas and the Caribbean.
